data: {"answered":true,"answer":"Taylor Example: 87 chamber speeches labelled gambling from 2025-07-22; Pat Example: 60 chamber speeches labelled gambling from 2025-07-22; Alex Example: 52 chamber speeches labelled gambling from 2025-07-22. Including committee hearings: Alex Example: 130, Sam Sample: 94, Casey Sample: 65. Counting speeches in the current parliament since July 2025. Topic counts cover labelled speeches, about 73% of the record: 89% of the 2020s, 91% of the 2010s, 63% of the 2000s and 22% of the 1990s, so older years are undercounted. Counts are chamber speeches; committee-hearing turns are separate records and are not included. A speaker name can be a surname-only record for some state members. Some federal debate records hold more than one speaker under one name (a known source fault being repaired).","citations":{"fact-1/t/body/0":[[0,69]],"fact-2/t/body/0":[[70,137]],"fact-3/t/body/0":[[138,206]],"fact-4/t/body/0":[[138,255]],"fact-5/t/body/0":[[138,271]],"fact-6/t/body/0":[[138,289]],"coverage/t/body/0":[[351,795]]},"sources":[{"resource":"fact-1","slug":"","kind":"count","title":"Taylor Example: 87 chamber speeches labelled gambling from 2025-07-22","href":"https://opax.com.au/search?kind=speech&topic=gambling&speaker=Taylor+Example&from=2025","url":"https://opax.com.au/search?kind=speech&topic=gambling&speaker=Taylor+Example&from=2025","snippet":"Taylor Example: 87 chamber speeches labelled gambling from 2025-07-22","cited":true},{"resource":"fact-2","slug":"","kind":"count","title":"Pat Example: 60 chamber speeches labelled gambling from 2025-07-22","href":"https://opax.com.au/search?kind=speech&topic=gambling&speaker=Pat+Example&from=2025","url":"https://opax.com.au/search?kind=speech&topic=gambling&speaker=Pat+Example&from=2025","snippet":"Pat Example: 60 chamber speeches labelled gambling from 2025-07-22","cited":true},{"resource":"fact-3","slug":"","kind":"count","title":"Alex Example: 52 chamber speeches labelled gambling from 2025-07-22","href":"https://opax.com.au/search?kind=speech&topic=gambling&speaker=Alex+Example&from=2025","url":"https://opax.com.au/search?kind=speech&topic=gambling&speaker=Alex+Example&from=2025","snippet":"Alex Example: 52 chamber speeches labelled gambling from 2025-07-22","cited":true},{"resource":"fact-4","slug":"","kind":"count","title":"Alex Example: 130 committee-hearing turns","href":"https://opax.com.au/search?kind=speech&topic=gambling&speaker=Alex+Example&from=2025","url":"https://opax.com.au/search?kind=speech&topic=gambling&speaker=Alex+Example&from=2025","snippet":"Alex Example: 130 committee-hearing turns","cited":true},{"resource":"fact-5","slug":"","kind":"count","title":"Sam Sample: 94 committee-hearing turns","href":"https://opax.com.au/search?kind=speech&topic=gambling&speaker=Sam+Sample&from=2025","url":"https://opax.com.au/search?kind=speech&topic=gambling&speaker=Sam+Sample&from=2025","snippet":"Sam Sample: 94 committee-hearing turns","cited":true},{"resource":"fact-6","slug":"","kind":"count","title":"Casey Sample: 65 committee-hearing turns","href":"https://opax.com.au/search?kind=speech&topic=gambling&speaker=Casey+Sample&from=2025","url":"https://opax.com.au/search?kind=speech&topic=gambling&speaker=Casey+Sample&from=2025","snippet":"Casey Sample: 65 committee-hearing turns","cited":true},{"resource":"coverage","slug":"","kind":"record","title":"Source coverage and methods","href":"https://opax.com.au/methods","url":"https://opax.com.au/methods","snippet":"Topic counts cover labelled speeches, about 73% of the record: 89% of the 2020s, 91% of the 2010s, 63% of the 2000s and 22% of the 1990s, so older years are undercounted. Counts are chamber speeches; committee-hearing turns are separate records and are not included. A speaker name can be a surname-only record for some state members. Some federal debate records hold more than one speaker under one name (a known source fault being repaired).","cited":true}],"followups":[{"label":"Who is making the